      "writtenOn": "2020-04-29T18:29:16Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "But it isn\u0027t limited to TX_HARD_RST; it is the the general SOP* TX complete bit\n\nfrom spec\n\n\"B6 - Transmit SOP* Message Successful -\nReset or SOP* message transmission successful. GoodCRC\nresponse received on SOP* message transmission. Transmit SOP*\nmessage buffer registers are empty.\"\n\n\nThat is why I am saying that the code in the alert handler is notifying when we finish sending any PD message (like PS_READY for example)",
      "parentUuid": "15628407_c3a0079d",
